#: templates/student-hub/school-rollover.php:14
msgid "Move the active classes of one year into another active year. Each class with active students gets a class of the same name and grade in the new year; its students, course links and roster course access move with it. Classes without active students are archived without a new class unless you include them. The source year and its classes are archived; assignments and learning records stay in them."
